# (label, hints, back, ahead, pattern). A pattern only runs in a small window around each place where
# one of its lowercase hints appears (from `back` bytes before to `ahead` bytes after), so the
# 600,000-file scan of a busy server costs one read, one lower() and a few substring finds per file.
